                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pros:\r\n- I like this story. It's funny\r\n- gameplay repetitive, but ok\r\n\r\nCons:\r\n- No map, no idea where to go (if there is a map, I would finish the game in twice less time because I had to visit all places again and again to find quest items)\r\n- Bugs. If you cannot finish some quest like \"kill all blobs and all blobs are killed\", try to talk to sellers and maybe one of them say something and quest would be auto-completed\r\n- When I killed final boss, no portal appear LOL, but I found a place where it should be and hero was able to enter it :D\r\n\r\nYou know, I like the jokes and stupid silly story. I was enjoying it somewhy. I recommend to try this game. It  has good voice acting and it's fun in general :D\r\n\r\n\r\nI didn't play the first part because it has no voice over. I don't know if second game is better or worse than first one",
